<%#
  Turn Action "Action" row — the chosen action folded into a builder-style
  step row: an uppercase "Action" label, the action's name, the confirm slot
  the Commit proxy lands in, and a Change button that re-opens the action menu.
  Shared by the static panes here (Item / End Turn); the JS-mounted panes
  (Attack / Cast / Move / Special) emit the identical row via
  turnCommit.js → actionRowHtml(). Keep the two in sync.

  Locals:
    label — the action's display name (e.g. "Item", "End Turn").
%>
<div class="step-summary ta-action-row">
  <span class="step-summary-label">Action</span>
  <span class="step-summary-value ta-action-name"><%= label %></span>
  <span class="ta-confirm-slot"></span>
  <button type="button" class="ta-change"><span class="cr-change-icon">↶</span> Change</button>
</div>
